address-atlas includes data derived from:

- Google libaddressinput address metadata
  https://github.com/google/libaddressinput — Apache License 2.0
- Unicode CLDR (country and subdivision names)
  https://cldr.unicode.org — Unicode License v3
- Chromium address form label translations
  https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src — BSD 3-Clause
- ISO 3166 codes (country and subdivision identifiers), with names cross-checked
  against Debian iso-codes https://salsa.debian.org/iso-codes-team/iso-codes
- Universal Postal Union addressing documents and national postal operators'
  published addressing guidance (facts: postal code formats, address order)
